# packages/api

- Export surface: `src/index.ts` and `./router-type`.
- Use `prisma` from `@warden/db`; never `new PrismaClient()` here.
- Auth lives in `src/auth/`; keep JWT/cookie names stable unless migrating clients.
- Must not import from `apps/*`.
- Env consumed at runtime via Next host process (JWT, Supabase keys).
